  "prefLabel": "Acp 105.01 Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 105.01 Meetings. The board shall meet no less than twice a year, and at such additional times as the board chair, or a majority of the board, shall designate. The time and place of the meetings shall be noticed to the public in accordance with RSA 91-A:2.\n\nSource. #7080, eff 8-26-99",
